&lt;p&gt;🚀 &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://help.penpot.app/technical-guide/getting-started/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Getting Started&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✏️ &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLgcCPfOv5v54WpXhHmNO7T-YC7AE-SRsr&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Tutorials&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏘️ &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://help.penpot.app/technical-guide/developer/architecture/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
